  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Caution",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Venerable placements come from fan sources rather than a pinned chapter, and Giant Sun's era is disputed with both positions on his own page. Dating from the present sits in the gated sections below. Chapter 464 says Early Antiquity where later chapters say Late Antiquity; both sit on this page as a conflict. The Chinese name for this era is uncited. This page states nothing about where the regional walls come from.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Demon Venerable is a rank nine demonic path Gu Master. An Immortal Venerable is a rank nine righteous Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The difference between demonic path and righteous path is one of ideals, debated since immemorial times with no conclusion on which is closer to the truth.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources do not agree on what to call the age after Medieval Antiquity.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_medieval"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources conflict:",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "From Immemorial Antiquity through Remote Antiquity, Olden Antiquity, and Medieval Antiquity comes Late Antiquity Era. Until today, the way of Gu prospered.",
      "chapters": [
        522
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_immemorial",
        "evt_era_remote",
        "evt_era_olden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From Immemorial Era through Remote, Olden, and Medieval Antiquity to Early Antiquity Era and the present age, about ten venerable-level Gu Immortals had appeared.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul Demon Venerable is a rank nine Gu Master who dominated his era. He created soul path, and among Immortal Venerables and Demon Venerables he is the rank nine Gu Immortal with the greatest killing nature.",
      "chapters": [
        422
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-demon-venerable",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "sys_gu_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul, Paradise Earth, and the Prophecy of Three Venerables.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "living-order-after-giant-sun",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "sys_prophecy_of_three_venerables"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Giant Sun Immortal Venerable, Spectral Soul appears next, and after that Demon Venerable dies, Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable rises on the righteous path. The Prophecy of Three Venerables names Spectral Soul, Paradise Earth, and Great Dream in that sequence.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "living-order-after-giant-sun",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sacred Feather City tied to Late Antiquity and Spectral Soul.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sacred-feather-city-origin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_sacred_feather_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sacred Feather City’s origin is traced to the Late Antiquity Era as the era of Spectral Soul Demon Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        870
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sacred-feather-city-origin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "How far back the Late Antiquity Era sits from the present.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hundred-thousand-years",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A hundred thousand years ago, during the Late Antiquity Era, soul path flourished.",
      "chapters": [
        695
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hundred-thousand-years",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable relative to Late Antiquity.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "where-giant-sun-sits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Three hundred thousand years ago was the Medieval Antiquity Era. Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable, Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable, and Giant Sun Immortal Venerable appeared in succession during that era.",
      "chapters": [
        1191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "where-giant-sun-sits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul’s will and a portion of his true inheritance in the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-souls-inheritance-in-play",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A portion of Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s true inheritance is already a live problem when Fang Yuan is told that the ghost face red lotus in the River of Time holds Spectral Soul’s will and that portion of the inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1403
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-souls-inheritance-in-play",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Paradise Earth through an inheritor, and how he ranks among the ten Venerables.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paradise-earth-inheritor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable is already named as lived and dead in the Prophecy of Three Venerables.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paradise-earth-inheritor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inheritor of Paradise Earth’s true inheritance expands that record. Among the ten Venerables, Paradise Earth is the kindest and most merciful, the one who healed the world after Spectral Soul’s rule, and who left his true inheritance in the Southern Border instead of joining Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1548
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paradise-earth-inheritor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_paradise_earth_true_inheritance",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Who belongs in the Late Era once both names are placed together under it.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "late-era-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the Medieval Antiquity Era comes the Late Antiquity Era, one hundred thousand years before the present. Spectral Soul and Paradise Earth appeared in this era.",
      "chapters": [
        1867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "late-era-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Late Antiquity among the ten Venerables.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-by-antiquity-block",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking across a period of over three million years from past to present, ten Gu cultivators stand at the peak. That list places Spectral Soul Demon Venerable and Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable in the Late Antiquity Era, a hundred thousand years ago. On that list Spectral Soul is ninth and Paradise Earth is tenth, the two names under Late Antiquity Era.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-by-antiquity-block",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Obtaining Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-paradise-earth-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance is obtained in that stretch.",
      "chapters": [
        2087
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-paradise-earth-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
